    "updated_at": "2018-03-28T13:04:14Z",
    "body": "Argument for Safari: you can clear each node's event listener list, potentially without iteration of those lists depending on GC specifics.\r\n\r\nArgument for Chrome: it matches `removeEventListener()`.\r\n\r\n(I'm somewhat inclined to go with Chrome, unless someone can find another example where we remove one or more event listeners without setting the \"removed\" field.)",
