    "body": "Looking at https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/WebKit/Source/core/dom/Node.cpp?l=2054&gsn=RemoveAllEventListenersRecursively it seems Chrome (and presumably Safari) also runs this method during unload. So if we're going to end up with two callers we probably want this to be a primitive defined in DOM.",
